### add a product
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cyber Conference",
  "category": "IST",
  "price": 10,
  "description": "Cyber security conference ticket"
}

### get all products
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products

### update a product
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/products/6afa6044a814a97e3146fb44
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 12
}

### delete a product
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/products/PASTE_ID_HERE

### get all carts
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders